    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/f85fa6d8a2217c5b9d81a24b9d36d199.avif?t=1754657337\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/da1d9f9e5d5ec414046df9cdc9938c59.avif?t=1754657337\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/1e0e1b4fb7fca238b9e4454832749d31.avif?t=1754657337\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/32233defe8f808613db8b4bd3731d8d4.avif?t=1754657337\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/e716c87f12a69ca4eec6cfcad89969fb.avif?t=1754657337\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/f429e38290e2e8fed1c944c1ee891485.avif?t=1754657337\" /></span><br><br>Repeat After Me, the multiplayer game for single players! Make this work, by utilizing your unique ability of cloning yourself at any time and record any action you can think of. Your clones will forever repeat your every step - or misstep. Can you work with yourself?<br><br>In this third-person puzzle game, you play as Plamb who is trapped in a magical confinement and longs to escape. To progress on this quest, many different puzzles are blocking your way. They require many hands but you play alone. Luckily, Plamb has the ability to clone itself multiple times, show each clone a sequence of arbitrary actions and they will keep executing them in a loop forever. With your own helping hands you can now try to find a way out!<br><br>Repeat After Me is all about working with yourself, taking on multiple new perspectives on scenarios and finding creative solutions to overcome impossible obstacles.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/f85fa6d8a2217c5b9d81a24b9d36d199.avif?t=1754657337\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/da1d9f9e5d5ec414046df9cdc9938c59.avif?t=1754657337\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/1e0e1b4fb7fca238b9e4454832749d31.avif?t=1754657337\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/32233defe8f808613db8b4bd3731d8d4.avif?t=1754657337\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/e716c87f12a69ca4eec6cfcad89969fb.avif?t=1754657337\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470830/extras/f429e38290e2e8fed1c944c1ee891485.avif?t=1754657337\" /></span><br><br>Repeat After Me, the multiplayer game for single players! Make this work, by utilizing your unique ability of cloning yourself at any time and record any action you can think of. Your clones will forever repeat your every step - or misstep. Can you work with yourself?<br><br>In this third-person puzzle game, you play as Plamb who is trapped in a magical confinement and longs to escape. To progress on this quest, many different puzzles are blocking your way. They require many hands but you play alone. Luckily, Plamb has the ability to clone itself multiple times, show each clone a sequence of arbitrary actions and they will keep executing them in a loop forever. With your own helping hands you can now try to find a way out!<br><br>Repeat After Me is all about working with yourself, taking on multiple new perspectives on scenarios and finding creative solutions to overcome impossible obstacles.",
